    "Share is each attacker's damage of the %@ the %@ took. NPCs have no pilot or security status. The small plate is the weapon; a pilot in a capsule fought with drones." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Anteil zeigt, wie viel jeder Angreifer zu den %1$@ Schadenspunkten am Ziel (%2$@) beigetragen hat. NPCs haben keinen Piloten und keinen Sicherheitsstatus. Das kleine Schild zeigt die Waffe; ein Pilot in einer Kapsel hat mit Drohnen gekämpft."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Share is each attacker's damage of the %1$@ the %2$@ took. NPCs have no pilot or security status. The small plate is the weapon; a pilot in a capsule fought with drones."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Доля — вклад атакующего в %1$@ ед. урона, полученного целью (%2$@). У NPC нет пилота и статуса безопасности. Маленькая плашка — оружие; пилот в капсуле сражался дронами."
          }
        }
      }
    },
